# Filled-in documents carry real client, personal and banking details. This repository is public:
# keep filled copies and every printed PDF out of version control (see README.md, Privacy).
# Bracket patterns keep the rules case-insensitive on case-sensitive checkouts.
*.[fF][iI][lL][lL][eE][dD].[hH][tT][mM][lL]
*.[pP][dD][fF]
[fF][iI][lL][lL][eE][dD]/
